{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i", "title": "離婁上", "description": "孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方", "occurrences": 30, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "仁", "variants": [], "id": "仁"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "因", "id": "因"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "失", "id": "失"}, {"form": "守", "id": "守"}, {"form": "安", "id": "安"}, {"form": "實", "id": "實"}, {"form": "居", "id": "居"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "敺", "id": "敺"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "歸", "id": "歸"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "法", "id": "法"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "諸侯", "id": "諸侯"}, {"form": "身", "id": "身"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.5409593240373143, "source": "下", "target": "因"}, {"weight": 2.847812143477369, "source": "下", "target": "守"}, {"weight": 3.1354942159291497, "source": "下", "target": "法"}, {"weight": 1.289667525430819, "source": "下", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.2881963555419462, "source": "下", "target": "歸"}, {"weight": 1.749199854809259, "source": "下", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 4.23410650459726, "source": "下", "target": "水"}, {"weight": 1.001985452979038, "source": "惡", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.847812143477369, "source": "惡", "target": "樂"}, {"weight": 2.1546649629174235, "source": "敺", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 3.5409593240373143, "source": "敺", "target": "諸侯"}, {"weight": 0.9611634584587828, "source": "天下", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.0152306797290584, "source": "天下", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 1.1975522365230131, "source": "天下", "target": "失"}, {"weight": 1.55